{"about_the_game":"'Jesus Christ Simulator' is a new take on the 'Superhero Simulator' game genre.<br>The game immerses you in a huge American City, where you are tasked by God with fixing the broken system that humans have been forced to live in.<br><br>You are 'the' Ultimate Superhero!<br><br>You will help bring prosperity to humankind, and use your Powers to bring light back to the world.<br><br>Perform exorcisms, pay off people's debts, pay their rent, furnish them with a car, and much more... You will do the things that actual superheroes would do!<br><br>As Jesus, you can travel to Hell and save the souls that are trapped there, from their torment! Or condemn them for their crimes!<br><br>Armed with Unlimited Miracles, Flight, God Lasers, and Superpowers, you can use your power to change the world, to help people, to save lives, and to destroy the system that enslaves them!<br><br>But beware, there are demons everywhere...<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921650/extras/download__1_.gif?t=1733696497\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921650/extras/Copy_of_Untitled_Design__3_.gif?t=1733696497\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921650/extras/Copy_of_Untitled_Design.gif?t=1733696497\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921650/extras/Copy_of_Untitled_Design__4_.gif?t=1733696497\" /><br><br><br>More playable cities are being planned for the future!!!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921650/extras/Copy_of_Untitled_Design__1_.gif?t=1733696497\" /><br><br>Made by one dude, on a $100 budget.<br>(Please excuse any still-existing bugs, I'm still fleshing them out).","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2921650?t=1733696497","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921650/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1733696497","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921650/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1733696497","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921650/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1733696497","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The demons you will encounter as Jesus Christ, can be killed with your heat vision, and exploded into bloody balls.\r\n\r\nAs Jesus, you will help out the poor by destroying 'Bank of Greed' ATM machines. Most of what you do could be considered criminal behavior, in pursuit of destroying the system and helping humanity.\r\n\r\nThe demons may instill fear into the hearts of any man who plays this game."},"detailed_description":"'Jesus Christ Simulator' is a new take on the 'Superhero Simulator' game genre.<br>The game immerses you in a huge American City, where you are tasked by God with fixing the broken system that humans have been forced to live in.<br><br>You are 'the' Ultimate Superhero!<br><br>You will help bring prosperity to humankind, and use your Powers to bring light back to the world.<br><br>Perform exorcisms, pay off people's debts, pay their rent, furnish them with a car, and much more... You will do the things that actual superheroes would do!<br><br>As Jesus, you can travel to Hell and save the souls that are trapped there, from their torment! Or condemn them for their crimes!<br><br>Armed with Unlimited Miracles, Flight, God Lasers, and Superpowers, you can use your power to change the world, to help people, to save lives, and to destroy the system that enslaves them!<br><br>But beware, there are demons everywhere...<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921650/extras/download__1_.gif?t=1733696497\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921650/extras/Copy_of_Untitled_Design__3_.gif?t=1733696497\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921650/extras/Copy_of_Untitled_Design.gif?t=1733696497\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921650/extras/Copy_of_Untitled_Design__4_.gif?t=1733696497\" /><br><br><br>More playable cities are being planned for the future!!!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921650/extras/Copy_of_Untitled_Design__1_.gif?t=1733696497\" /><br><br>Made by one dude, on a $100 budget.<br>(Please excuse any still-existing bugs, I'm still fleshing them out).","developers":["Luke Grayson"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921650/header.jpg?t=1733696497","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257027479,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257027479/movie480.mp4?t=1720928653","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257027479/movie_max.mp4?t=1720928653"},"name":"Awesome Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257027479/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1720928653","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257027479/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1720928653","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257027479/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1720928653"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257045590,"mp4":{"480